        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(agents): reject invalid goal token budgets",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nFixes an issue where agents using `create_goal` with malformed `token_budget` values such as `\"42.9\"` or `\"1abc\"` could create a goal with a truncated numeric budget instead of getting an invalid-input error.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\n`create_goal` now advertises `token_budget` as an integer with a minimum of 1 and uses the shared strict positive-integer reader at the model-facing tool boundary. Invalid present values are rejected before any session goal is created, while valid positive integer budgets keep the existing goal creation path.\n\n## User Impact\n\nGoal token budgets now match the documented positive-budget contract, so agents cannot silently create goals with a different budget than the value they supplied.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- Claim proved: malformed and non-positive `create_goal.token_budget` values are rejected by the real model-facing tool invocation, `get_goal` reads back no goal after those invalid calls, and a valid positive integer budget still creates an active goal.\n- Current-head real behavior proof at `01d0a7d9c957675317d6a44d6a31e118e50e2786`: `node --import tsx --input-type=module -` imported `createCreateGoalTool`, `createGetGoalTool`, `upsertSessionEntry`, and `resolveStorePath`, seeded an isolated temp session row, then invoked the real `create_goal` and `get_goal` tool executors.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"head\": \"01d0a7d9c957675317d6a44d6a31e118e50e2786\",\n  \"proofPath\": [\n    \"upsertSessionEntry\",\n    \"createCreateGoalTool\",\n    \"create_goal.execute\",\n    \"createGetGoalTool\",\n    \"get_goal.execute\"\n  ],\n  \"invalidResults\": [\n    {\n      \"tokenBudget\": \"42.9\",\n      \"rejected\": true,\n      \"message\": \"token_budget must be a positive integer\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"tokenBudget\": \"1abc\",\n      \"rejected\": true,\n      \"message\": \"token_budget must be a positive integer\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"tokenBudget\": 0,\n      \"rejected\": true,\n      \"message\": \"token_budget must be a positive integer\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"afterInvalid\": {\n    \"hasGoal\": false,\n    \"status\": \"missing\"\n  },\n  \"validCreate\": {\n    \"status\": \"created\",\n    \"tokenBudget\": 42\n  },\n  \"afterValid\": {\n    \"hasGoal\": true,\n    \"objective\": \"prove valid budget still works\",\n    \"tokenBudget\": 42,\n    \"status\": \"active\"\n  },\n  \"assertions\": {\n    \"invalidRejected\": true,\n    \"invalidMessages\": true,\n    \"noGoalAfterInvalid\": true,\n    \"validBudgetStillCreatesGoal\": true\n  }\n}\n```\n\n- Focused regression proof at `01d0a7d9c957675317d6a44d6a31e118e50e2786`: `node scripts/run-vitest.mjs src/agents/tools/goal-tools.test.ts` passed with 1 test file and 6 tests.\n- Committed diff hygiene: `git diff --check HEAD~1..HEAD` passed.\n- Review proof: `python .agents\\skills\\autoreview\\scripts\\autoreview --mode commit --commit HEAD` passed with no accepted/actionable findings.",
